	"data": "Cybership\n\nCybership is cithoreal's primary gaming/personal drive on the Star system — a 1.8 TB NVMe partition (/dev/nvme0n1p2) mounted at /run/media/cithoreal/Cybership. It hosts the Steam library, personal projects, and archived data.\n\nSee also: [[infra/drives/star-cybership|Drive: Cybership]] · [[infra/star|Star]]",
